Emerging Market Opportunities
Opportunities are emerging in virtual power plant operations, smart EV charging, distributed battery coordination and industrial demand response. Aggregators that can provide reliable dispatch, performance verification and settlement services may benefit from growing demand for flexible grid resources.

Regional Market Insights
Europe accounted for an estimated 43% of the market in 2025, supported by demand response programmes, distributed energy integration and established flexibility procurement mechanisms.

North America offers opportunities through wholesale market participation and regulatory developments supporting distributed energy resources. Asia-Pacific is positioned for growth through smart grid investment, battery deployment and electric vehicle adoption. Latin America and the Middle East and Africa represent developing opportunities as utilities modernise their electricity systems.

